onboarding plan. Inputs: only

110
00:11:28.667 --> 00:11:33.000
the supplied role requirements, skills
summary, schedule, and approved resources.

111
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.333
Instructions: identify gaps, sequence
activities, assign an owner, and map

112
00:11:37.333 --> 00:11:41.667
each activity to a role requirement.
Constraints: do not infer

113
